Bind Npc 29014 Zone 71 for karus
Bind Npc 29027 Zone 71 for elmorad
Quest 707 "[Lemegeton] To the underworld…"
    Journal for karus "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Bros."
    Journal for elmorad "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Sais."
    Collect 1 of 900225000
    Collect 1 of 900226000

Requires (player level >= 70 and player is karus and quest 705 is completed) or (player level >= 70 and player is elmorad and quest 706 is completed)

Rewards
    Give 250000 experience
    Give 30000 coins

On available
    Say "I don't what it is but what you did must be something amazing. Hehe, this feels great. Let's keep on rocking!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "You are here. Your last work was great."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Please give me the seal Scroll that you will seal in your body, then, <selfname>.\n\nWe must give Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [35Devil] Marchosias and [59Devil] Oriax."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You are here. Your last work was great."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Please give me the seal Scroll that you will seal in your body, then, <selfname>.\n\nWe must give Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [35Devil] Marchosias and [59Devil] Oriax."

On in_progress
    If player is karus
        Say "Where is the seal Scroll?"
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Where did you two sealed?"

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "Thank you. With this seal Scroll, the soul of devil will be locked in this ring."
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "Thank you.Now sealed with the soul drank in the ring will be locked."

On completed
    Say "Hmm ... You need to go to the underworld. The devil this time is [23Devil] Aim, the duke of destruction. With him are [47Devil] Uvall and [66Devil] Cimejes. They are all very powerful. Be careful."
